msgstr "Erle-Brain2 接线图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:21
#: 402b89e92d1b413fab75f2f245fa633f
msgid ""
"Copter users should also see the `official setup documentation "
"<http://docs.erlerobotics.com/erle_robots/erle_copter>`__."
msgstr ""
"多旋翼飞行器用户也可参阅 `官方设置文档 "
"<http://docs.erlerobotics.com/erle_robots/erle_copter>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:26
#: bbb8c99b734d44bebb4f32ae85b1ec1b
msgid "Power Erle-Brain2"
msgstr "为 Erle-Brain2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:28
#: 5b24f5766660480e9de57836981eaf89
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 is typically powered via its \"power\" port, as shown in the "
"picture below. The power port simultaneously powers Erle-Brain2 and reads "
"voltage and current analog measurements."
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 通常通过其「电源」接口供电，如下图所示。电源接口同时为 Erle-Brain2 供电并读取电压和电流模拟量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:35
#: 7d3a1be8903c4e6e988d3525fd356174
msgid ""
"Additionally, for developing/configuration purposes, it can be powered using"
" a micro USB charger (2A recommended), as shown in the below picture."
msgstr "此外，出于开发/配置目的，也可使用 Micro USB 充电器（推荐 2A）供电，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:44
#: 2959d2eb654f4a7db9bb516b80e9c1bf
msgid "Always use a power module to feed Erle-Brain2 while flying your drone"
msgstr "飞行无人机时，请始终使用电源模块为 Erle-Brain2 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:48
#: 177ff14cfe9d4e4d80a7178b164240cb
msgid "Connect remote control inputs"
msgstr "连接遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:50
#: 5a14a6bb46474f6383d1620fe742c874
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 is compatible with PPM remote control (RC) receivers. For "
"traditional single-wire-per-channel (PWM) receivers a PPM encoder can be "
"used to convert the receiver outputs to PPM-SUM."
msgstr ""
"Erle-Brain2 兼容 PPM 遥控（RC）接收机。对于传统的单线每通道（PWM）接收机，可使用 PPM 编码器将接收机输出转换为 PPM-SUM"
" 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:54
#: caa549e3d4564587a18d5e86a75e178f
msgid ""
"For more information see :ref:`Compatible RC Transmitter and Receiver "
"Systems (Erle-Brain 2) <common-compatible-rc-transmitter-and-receiver-"
"systems-erle-brain-2>`."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参见 :ref:`兼容的遥控发射机和接收机系统（Erle-Brain 2）<common-compatible-rc-transmitter-"
"and-receiver-systems-erle-brain-2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:59
#: fd7a40f9d2a74297803163491d3c897b
msgid "FRSky Taranis Transmitter"
msgstr "FRSky Taranis 遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:62
#: 0507b12c73f64b5d9125bc95cdd124f9
msgid "GPS+Compass"
msgstr "GPS+罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:64
#: f6baf89a14114df9a453e10e0ee25ee6
msgid ""
"The `uBlox GPS + Compass Module "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-neo-m8n-gps-with-"
"compass-kit/>`__ is the recommended GPS for Erle-Brain2. The GPS port is "
"connected with the six-position DF13 cable, and the Compass port is "
"connected to the I2C port with the four-position DF13 cable, as shown in the"
" :ref:`wiring chart above <common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start_erle-"
"brain2_wiring_chart>`."
msgstr ""
"`uBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/gpscompass-ublox-"
"neo-m8n-gps-with-compass-kit/>`__ 是 Erle-Brain2 推荐使用的 GPS。GPS 接口使用六针 DF13 "
"线缆连接，罗盘接口使用四针 DF13 线缆连接到 I2C 接口，如 :ref:`上方接线图 <common-erle-brain2-wiring-"
"quick-start_erle-brain2_wiring_chart>` 所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:71
#: e33345fda5e94e2db03e8ee2adcb328b
msgid "Connect Motors"
msgstr "连接电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:78
#: 466a324170334064b1ecee1cd6796016
msgid ""
"Be aware of how you connect ESCs wires to PWM rail. The signal wire (white "
"or orange color) should be connected at the top, the ground wire (black or "
"brown color) at the bottom."
msgstr "注意电调线缆连接到 PWM 总线的方式。信号线（白色或橙色）应连接在上方，地线（黑色或棕色）应连接在下方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:84
#: 0bc24ad0b6da44769ab5b4791fa76d18
msgid ""
"For Copter see :ref:`Connect ESCs and Motors <copter:connect-escs-and-"
"motors>`."
msgstr "多旋翼飞行器请参见 :ref:`连接电调和电机 <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:86
#: a43205dd683e480ca86aed631c07f922
msgid ""
"In overview, for copters connect each signal wire from the PDB to the main "
"output signal (S) pins by motor number:"
msgstr "总体而言，对于多旋翼飞行器，将 PDB 的每根信号线按电机编号连接到主输出信号（S）引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:89
#: c57ad31aadbb40aaa1203c637a53b0de
msgid "Pin 1 = Motor 1 - - Pin 5 = Motor 5"
msgstr "Pin 1 = 电机 1 - - Pin 5 = 电机 5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:90
#: 82e90dad9d9b4a0ba0db75f7981a0fe0
msgid "Pin 2 = Motor 2 - - Pin 6 = Motor 6"
msgstr "Pin 2 = 电机 2 - - Pin 6 = 电机 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:91
#: 0b2b21751b08441f9c5f76858f4b9efe
msgid "Pin 3 = Motor 3 - - Pin 7 = Motor 7"
msgstr "Pin 3 = 电机 3 - - Pin 7 = 电机 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:92
#: 649db5c23c3d477d91389849904242b6
msgid "Pin 4 = Motor 4 - - Pin 8 = Motor 8"
msgstr "Pin 4 = 电机 4 - - Pin 8 = 电机 8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:101
#: fc4ff09a5adb44af9eaf6c39906c12bb
msgid "USB ports"
msgstr "USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:103
#: 5828c4ee1db2402a8de96336f0cb3833
msgid ""
"Erle-Brain2 has four USB ports. Some of the devices you can connect are "
"listed in the following section."
msgstr "Erle-Brain2 有四个 USB 接口。以下部分列出了一些可连接的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:107
#: ffb8cc8d8e024f7096cd3d1c6bafaebe
msgid "WiFi dongle"
msgstr "WiFi 接收器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:109
#: f0fe854d945247a5a7f18b1c9cfe2451
msgid ""
"Use a (regular or high gain) WiFi dongle to create a hotspot that can, for "
"example, be used for sending telemetry data and commands to a Ground "
"Station. Erle-Brain2 automatically generates a WiFi hotspot when the dongle "
"is connected."
msgstr ""
"使用（普通或高增益）WiFi 接收器创建热点，例如用于向地面站发送数传数据和指令。当接收器连接后，Erle-Brain2 会自动生成 WiFi 热点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:116
#: 5c932489dc4448fbabf2b31a88a6707d
msgid ""
"Edimax AC (regular and high gain) are the officially supported dongles. "
"These can be purchased from Erle-Brain with your autopilot/vehicle."
msgstr "Edimax AC（普通和高增益）是官方支持的接收器。可随飞控/飞行器一起从 Erle-Brain 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:121
#: ff774c82e9cf450987fdeb44fcb2555b
msgid "Bluetooth dongle"
msgstr "蓝牙接收器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:123
#: 6c2230b3136c4a778b2d76657725ff0e
msgid ""
"Use a Bluetooth dongle to connect additional devices, such as joysticks."
msgstr "使用蓝牙接收器连接其他设备，例如游戏手柄。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:127
#: 8ecca40705aa4b10be772b99f56cefdb
msgid "You will need to configure BlueTooth interface to make it work"
msgstr "您需要配置蓝牙接口才能使其正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-erle-brain2-wiring-quick-start.rst:133
#: 8ef182b5ce9747f9b4f2a27361936126
